    "committer": "Patrick Aboyoun <aboyoun.patrick@gene.com>",
    "message": "docs: correct 4 perf benchmark numbers in NEWS.md for proper block-shape fixtures\n\nfix: replace unstable raw-moment correlatePairs() formula with sparse-aware Chan combination\n\nfix: recalibrate initializeCpp's memory_limit guard\n\nperf: fuse normalizeCounts() default path into one window-function query\n\nperf: drop redundant pre-filter before 5 QC-metrics joins\n\nperf: fuse scran two-pass mean/variance into one GROUP BY query\n",
    "time": 1793914843
